{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "IRoute — Driver Job Flow",
    "description": "Complete driver mobile job flow from login to job closed.\nFollows A1 through A10 as defined in IRoute document.\nUse {{base_url}} variable = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/mobile\nUse {{access_token}} variable = filled automatically after login.\nUse {{job_id}} variable = filled after dashboard call.\nUse {{shipment_id}} variable = filled after A4 executes.\nUse {{capture_bundle_id}} variable = filled after POD capture.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/mobile"
    },
    {
      "key": "driver_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "driver_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tenant_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "job_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "job_type",
      "value": "shipment"
    },
    {
      "key": "shipment_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "capture_bundle_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "content_hash",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "workflow_version",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Login (Get Access Token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{driver_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{driver_password}}\",\n  \"tenant_id\": \"{{tenant_id}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": "{{base_url}}/driver/auth/login/",
        "description": "STEP 1 — FIRST API TO CALL.\nSend driver email, password, tenant_id in body.\nAfter success, access_token is auto-saved to collection variable.\nAll subsequent requests use Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}.\nResponse key is data.access_token (not 'access', not 'token').\nIf login fails check: email format, password, tenant_id is correct.\nNOTE: Login field is 'email' not 'phone'.\nSet driver_email in collection variables before running."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var resp = pm.response.json();",
              "if (resp.status === 1 && resp.data && resp.data.access_token) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", resp.data.access_token);",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", resp.data.refresh_token);",
              "    pm.test(\"Login successful, token saved\", function() { pm.expect(resp.status).to.eql(1); });",
              "} else {",
              "    pm.test(\"Login failed — check phone, password, tenant_id\", function() { pm.expect(resp.status).to.eql(1); });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Dashboard (Get Active Job)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/driver/dashboard/",
        "description": "STEP 2 — CALL AFTER LOGIN.\nReturns active job assigned to driver.\njob_id and job_type are auto-saved from response.\njob_type will be 'shipment' for normal delivery jobs.\nIf no active_job in response then no job is assigned yet.\nCheck data.active_job.job_id and data.active_job.job_type.\nThese variables are used in all job detail and action calls."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var resp = pm.response.json();",
              "if (resp.data && resp.data.active_job) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"job_id\", resp.data.active_job.job_id);",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"job_type\", resp.data.active_job.job_type || \"shipment\");",
              "    pm.test(\"Active job found, job_id saved\", function() { pm.expect(resp.data.active_job.job_id).to.exist; });",
              "} else {",
              "    pm.test(\"No active job assigned to driver\", function() { pm.expect(resp.data.active_job).to.exist; });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Job Detail (See Current State)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/driver/jobs/{{job_type}}/{{job_id}}/",
        "description": "STEP 3 — CALL TO SEE FULL JOB STATE BEFORE ANY ACTION.\nURL uses job_type and job_id from dashboard response.\njob_type is usually 'shipment'.\nResponse shows current state, next allowed action, cargo, addresses.\nCheck data.next_action to know which action to fire next.\nCheck data.shipment_id — will be null until A4 fires.\nThis API can be called anytime to refresh job state.\n\nIMPORTANT: Call Job Detail before the FIRST execute only.\nAfter each execute fires, sync_metadata is automatically\nupdated from the execute response.\nYou do NOT need to re-call Job Detail between actions\nas long as you run them in order.\nOnly call Job Detail again if you skip a step or\nif you get a 409 stale_content_hash error."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var resp = pm.response.json();",
              "if (resp.data && resp.data.sync_metadata) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(",
              "        \"content_hash\",",
              "        resp.data.sync_metadata.content_hash",
              "    );",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(",
              "        \"workflow_version\",",
              "        resp.data.sync_metadata.workflow_version",
              "    );",
              "    pm.test(",
              "        \"Sync metadata saved for execute\",",
              "        function() {",
              "            pm.expect(resp.data.sync_metadata.content_hash).to.exist;",
              "        }",
              "    );",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
